# The full research catalogue stays local. It carries ~100 columns of analysis
# (X-ray luminosities, mass-loss rates, torques) that this project does not
# read and that are not ready to publish. `targets.csv` is the nine-column
# subset the pipeline actually uses, and that one IS committed -- regenerate it
# with `python make_targets.py`.
full_sample_dataframe.csv

# build/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# GitHub Pages serves the repository contents as-is -- there is no build step on
# their side -- so build/index.html and build/textures/ have to be committed for
# the browser preview to be reachable at the Pages URL. Everything in build/ is
# regenerated by `python build.py`; commit it after rebuilding rather than
# editing it in place.
